10 REM LOGIC GARDEN 64AG: PICNIC
20 PRINT CHR$(147) : REM CLEAR
30 POKE 53280, 14 : POKE 53281, 14 : REM SKY BLUE

40 REM --- DRAW BLANKET (PETSCII) ---
50 FOR Y = 10 TO 15
60 FOR X = 10 TO 30
70 C = 160 : REM SOLID BLOCK
80 PT = 1024 + (Y*40) + X
90 POKE PT, 160
100 IF (X+Y) AND 1 THEN POKE 55296+(PT-1024), 2 : REM RED
110 IF NOT((X+Y) AND 1) THEN POKE 55296+(PT-1024), 1 : REM WHITE
120 NEXT X
130 NEXT Y

200 REM --- SETUP SPRITES ---
210 S = 12288 : REM POINTERS
220 POKE S, 192 : REM KID 1
230 POKE S+1, 194 : REM KID 2
240 V = 53248
250 POKE V+21, 3 : REM ENABLE 0, 1
260 POKE V+39, 3 : REM KID 1 CYAN
270 POKE V+40, 4 : REM KID 2 PURPLE
280 POKE V, 100 : POKE V+1, 150
290 POKE V+2, 200 : POKE V+3, 150

300 REM --- DEFINE DATA ---
310 REM FRAME 1: HAND DOWN (192)
320 REM FRAME 2: HAND UP (193) - JUST COPY 192 AND EDIT
330 REM KID 2 USES 194/195 (MIRRORED) But for Basic just use same

400 REM --- EAT LOOP ---
410 FOR T = 0 TO 10
420 POKE S, 193 : REM KID 1 UP
430 FOR W = 0 TO 100 : NEXT
440 POKE S, 192 : REM KID 1 DOWN
450 POKE S+1, 195 : REM KID 2 UP (ASSUMING DATA EXISTS)
460 FOR W = 0 TO 100 : NEXT
470 POKE S+1, 194 : REM KID 2 DOWN
480 NEXT T
490 GOTO 410

